ind":"announcement","title":"Adjustments and Fixes","summary":"The announcement focuses on adjustments and fixes. For brand new content, please wait for the official version.Updates:You can now check the contents of the bento box.Distinguish original files from copied files when photocopying; copies can now be properly removed with a right-click.Active push task will apper more frequently.Working over 8 hours will count as overtime, reflecting a more realistic experience.Fixes:When a tutorial requests a slide, the chained slide will be ignored.The Employee ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:51:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694513","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1845383656380422","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Various Fiexes","summary":"Currently actively preparing for the game's release, so the update mainly focuses on fixes.Updates:You cannot keep drinking water when you're not thirsty.Added a vending machine to the pantry.Renamed matinee movie ticket to morning movie ticket for better clarification.Some sports mini-games will be slightly easier.Fixes:The list wasn't updating when implementing policies.Bank-related tutorials couldn't continue if the bank card was returned early.Fainting and leakages sometimes conflicted.Missi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T09:02:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1842846814452748","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Human Resource Department","summary":"Violations will now result in penalty reductions. Go to the HR department to buy indulgence and erase violation records.Other Update:Added multiple procurement items.Being late or absent will result in a violation.You can now review your lifetime log.Add shpaing underwear.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T10:20:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1841579228673190","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Add new procurements, fix banking tutorial, improve dialog box","summary":"New procurements: Slide Chain and Coupon PrinterFixed the issue where the bank-related tutorial couldn't be completed. The player should now receive the bank card correctly.Dialog box auto-scroll should now be handled more smoothly.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T11:10:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673190","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1840944183785086","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Package rework, surgeries, violations, and more","summary":"Package tasks have been rework to better reflect the task requirements.Player can now visit the hospital and get surgeries to adjust the body size.Player can now receive violations for not taking a shower, being late, or being absent.New mini-game for the thigh toner and yoga mat are available.Items and slides will unlock one by one as you progress.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T03:48:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785086","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1839676055892388","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Commute","summary":"Add a car dealership and purchase a vehicle to improve the commute time.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T10:22:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1839041357026163","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Fixed infinite loading and variant updates","summary":"The infinite loading issue when the player returns home is now fixed.Sorry for the inconvenience during this time, and thank you for all the suggestions and feedback.Also other updates:The calculator has been officially added to the game; you can procure it at the administration department.The administration department also provides some photocopy-related modules.The treadmill has its own mini-game now.Meet the new marketing department, which helps the player promote items to increase the freque","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T09:26:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357026163","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1837955055362856","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Fix photocopy quest and coupon book rework","summary":"The photocopy quest should be able to be completed now.Coupon book no longer requires scrolling around to find the corresponding coupon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T09:10:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055362856","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1837955055360912","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Panties, CEO, and more","summary":"Now the player can purchase and change the panties.Meet the company's CEO in the CEO's office. And more updates:Add movie ticket task.Add receipt reprint button procurement.The diaper can prevent incontinence.The CEO provides some policies; you can purchase them with the company seal.Cafeteria now only open for lunch.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T10:43:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1836506165557869","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Rename The Game","summary":"In order to capture the concept more accurately,The game has been officially renamed from Behind The ATM to Manual Teller Machine.All the mechanics and content stay the same.But you might need to reinstall the game in order for it to function correctly.And your save files also need to be migrated manually if you want to keep your current progress.Please follow the steps:Open file explorer, go to the \"%appdata%\\\\Godot\\\\app_userdata\\\\Behind The ATM\" folder. You can use the built-in search function","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T09:33:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165557869","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1835871199310779","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Don't forget to go to the restroom.","summary":"Holding it in for too long can lead to incontinence, and cleaning up takes a lot of time.Other updates:Added a parking fee payment task.Player now has menses.Added a cash recovery slide in procurement, allowing you to reset the money you output.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T11:14:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310779","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1835236783567422","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Boobs","summary":"Just like thigh and waist size, the player's boobs size can change now, too.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T10:13:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1834602721198113","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Belly","summary":"Players now have a belly that can get fat!It can be reduced through exercise in the future.Other updates:Added a grip strength limit, which can be checked in the diary.Added a hand grips mini-game, which can increase grip strength.Added gift card task to introduce the change mechanic.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T08:46:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1833968530896890","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Utility bill remake and exercise","summary":"The task of utility bill has now been refactored. It should be completed via fax.Compare to paper cutting and stamping, I feel this has more of a \"mechanical\" vibe.So the telephone has gained a brand-new function.You can get the latest tutorial from the office mentor.Correspondingly, a new photocopy task will require you to use the telephone to make copies.Another focus of thie update: the supermarket has exercies equipment available.Train your thighs throught the kettlebell mini-game.More equip","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T08:40:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530896890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1833334318575214","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"You are now obese.","summary":"Just kidding.The player can now upgrade the \"workbench\" by eating.The method for downgrading will be added in the future.Other update:NPCs look more vivid.The diary displays the size of your hips.You can cook at home.The supermarket displays the status of food.The bus stop has day night cycle.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-24T10:54:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318575214","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1832700592795937","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Package and ramen","summary":"Added package-related tasks and a ramen shop.Details:Overtime will now be shown in the monthly progress.Fixed the issues where work progress was not recorded after fainting.Highlight should be more noticeable.The slide folder has become more tighter.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-17T11:14:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592795937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1832065502819151","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Keyboard input support and various refactorings","summary":"Items that previously could only accept text input through the cursor, such as telephone and receipt, now support keyboard input!It was easier to implement than I expected.And refactorings on different systems: mainly for banking tutorials and daily reports.Detailed informationSlides, telephone, and receipt printer support keyboard input.You can now go to the office to have mentor replay tutorials.Depositing funds now has its own tutorial.Daily reports will provide ranking.Player deposits are no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-10T11:32:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502819151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1831432155573439","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix: Banking no bank card","summary":"Many people report that they are stuck with banking-related tasks.Initially, I thought the tutorial confused the player. I even tried to rework the tutorial to make it easier.But during the reworking, I found out that the tutorial indeed has a bug due to a recent feature I added.Now the bug is fixed.Thank you for all the feedback.Sorry for the unintended experience.Whether the tutorial is good or bad, you should now be able to continue the game without getting stuck.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-02T10:51:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155573439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4451770-1831432155570995","game_id":"steam-4451770","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam demo launched!","summary":"I'm happy to announce that the demo version of the game has officially launched.Regardless, there are still many features that have not yet been implemented.But I think the current state of the game should be able to give you a grasp of how the gameplay and the flavor would be.Any feedback would be welcome.There also some updates.Feature:Add an Employee of the Month wall to track your performance in the office.Add the series of KPI tasks to give you infinite work.Fix:Coupon codes now persist cor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T11:26:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155570995","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4451770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4451770":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4451770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4671470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:31:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4451770","app_id":4451770,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"55a88bb4e889ac74b04aaf6d6f520a06e26fb9662db9354d7c4fced3ea8a6a52","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_descrip